{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "7c1f0c52-therapedia-api-v1",
        "name": "Therapedia API v1",
        "description": "Koleksi endpoint backend Therapedia (Laravel 12 + Sanctum).\n\nStatus: M1 Auth (siap diuji). Endpoint modul lain ditambahkan per sprint.\n\nCara pakai:\n1. Jalankan backend: `php artisan serve` (default http://127.0.0.1:8000).\n2. Import koleksi ini + file environment `therapedia.local.postman_environment.json`, lalu pilih environment \"Therapedia Local\".\n3. Jalankan `1.1 Login staf` dulu: token otomatis tersimpan ke variabel `token` dan dipakai request lain.\n\nAkun master dari seeder: master@gmail.com / 123.\n\nCatatan: request yang butuh login memakai header Authorization: Bearer {{token}} (atau {{client_token}} untuk portal ortu). Bila 401 \"Sesi berakhir\": pastikan environment \"Therapedia Local\" TERPILIH dan variabel `token` terisi. Bila kosong, salin `data.token` dari respons login lalu tempel ke variabel `token`.",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "auth": {
        "type": "bearer",
        "bearer": [
            {
                "key": "token",
                "value": "{{token}}",
                "type": "string"
            }
        ]
    },
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "0. Health",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "0.1 Health check",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "noauth"
                        },
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{host}}/up",
                            "host": [
                                "{{host}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "up"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Cek aplikasi hidup. Respons 200."
                    },
                    "response": []
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "1. Auth Staf",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "1.1 Login staf",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('Login berhasil (200)', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                                    "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                                    "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                                    "  pm.environment.set('token', res.data.token);",
                                    "  pm.test('Token tersimpan ke variabel token', function () { pm.expect(res.data.token).to.be.a('string'); });",
                                    "  pm.test('Memuat daftar kode modul yang diizinkan', function () { pm.expect(res.data.user.permissions).to.be.an('array'); });",
                                    "}"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "noauth"
                        },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{staff_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{staff_password}}\"\n}",
                            "options": {
                                "raw": {
                                    "language": "json"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "auth",
                                "login"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Login staf. Sukses 200: `data.token`, `data.user` (role, cabang, `permissions` = daftar kode modul yang diizinkan, `must_change_password`).\n\nGagal: 422 dengan pesan yang sama untuk email salah / password salah / akun nonaktif. 5 kali gagal dari email+IP yang sama → 429 `too_many_attempts` (+ `retry_after` detik). Token berlaku 24 jam."
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "1.2 Profil sesi (me)",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "pm.test('200 OK', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                                    "pm.test('Tipe staff', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.type).to.eql('staff'); });"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Authorization",
                                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/me",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "auth",
                                "me"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Profil + izin modul pemilik token. Tanpa token → 401. Boleh dipanggil saat `must_change_password = true`."
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "1.3 Ganti password",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Authorization",
                                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"current_password\": \"{{staff_password}}\",\n  \"password\": \"PasswordBaru123\",\n  \"password_confirmation\": \"PasswordBaru123\"\n}",
                            "options": {
                                "raw": {
                                    "language": "json"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/change-password",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "auth",
                                "change-password"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Sukses 204 (tanpa isi). Aturan password baru: minimal 8 karakter, ada huruf dan angka, konfirmasi sama, beda dari password lama. Token milik perangkat lain dihapus; token ini tetap berlaku.\n\nPERHATIAN: setelah berhasil, password akun berubah. Ubah variabel `staff_password` di environment sesuai password baru, atau kembalikan lewat request ini lagi (current_password = PasswordBaru123).\n\nBila akun `must_change_password = true`, ini satu-satunya endpoint (selain me/logout) yang boleh dipakai."
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "1.4 Logout staf",
                    "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Authorization",
                                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "auth",
                                "logout"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Sukses 204. Hanya token yang dipakai yang dihapus (perangkat lain tetap login)."
                    },
                    "response": []
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "name": "2. Auth Orang Tua (Portal)",
            "item": [
                {
                    "name": "2.1 Login ortu",
                    "event": [
                        {
                            "listen": "test",
                            "script": {
                                "type": "text/javascript",
                                "exec": [
                                    "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                                    "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                                    "  pm.environment.set('client_token', res.data.token);",
                                    "  pm.test('Token ortu tersimpan ke variabel client_token', function () { pm.expect(res.data.token).to.be.a('string'); });",
                                    "} else {",
                                    "  pm.test('Gagal: 422 (data salah) atau 429 (terkunci)', function () { pm.expect([422, 429]).to.include(pm.response.code); });",
                                    "}"
                                ]
                            }
                        }
                    ],
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "noauth"
                        },
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                            "mode": "raw",
                            "raw": "{\n  \"client_code\": \"{{client_code}}\",\n  \"date_of_birth\": \"{{client_dob}}\"\n}",
                            "options": {
                                "raw": {
                                    "language": "json"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/client-login",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "auth",
                                "client-login"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Login portal ortu: kode client + tanggal lahir anak (yyyy-MM-dd). Butuh data client di database (belum ada dari seeder; akan ada setelah modul Client/Inquiry, atau isi manual lewat tinker).\n\nGagal: 422 dengan pesan generik (tidak menyebut mana yang salah). 5 gagal per kode (atau 20 per IP) → 429, terkunci 15 menit."
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "2.2 Profil sesi ortu (me)",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "bearer",
                            "bearer": [
                                {
                                    "key": "token",
                                    "value": "{{client_token}}",
                                    "type": "string"
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        "method": "GET",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Authorization",
                                "value": "Bearer {{client_token}}"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "Accept",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            }
                        ],
                        "url": {
                            "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/me",
                            "host": [
                                "{{base_url}}"
                            ],
                            "path": [
                                "auth",
                                "me"
                            ]
                        },
                        "description": "Memakai `client_token`. Respons `data.type = client` + ringkasan client (tanpa tanggal lahir/hasil asesmen)."
                    },
                    "response": []
                },
                {
                    "name": "2.3 Logout ortu",
                    "request": {
                        "auth": {
                            "type": "bearer",
                            "bearer": [
                                {
                                    "key": "token",
                                    "value": "{{client_token}}",
                                    "type": "string"
